+    Records are produced by RelationContractRecordAdd and the read edges
+    are exercised on them. The two read behaviors the write bridge
+    structurally prevents -- a variable-bearing store and conflicting
+    arity declarations -- are verified at the write refusal and then at
+    the read edge's unchanged refusal of hand-built instances.
